  m_Name: Evento_EpidemiaSazonal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Epidemia Sazonal
  _titleEn: Seasonal Epidemic
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Algumas doen\xE7as voltam todo ano na mesma esta\xE7\xE3o e lotam postos
    e hospitais."
  _summaryEn: Some diseases return every year in the same season and overcrowd clinics
    and hospitals.
  _realWorld: "A dengue, transmitida pelo mosquito Aedes aegypti, tem picos no ver\xE3o
    chuvoso brasileiro, e 2024 teve o maior n\xFAmero de casos j\xE1 registrado no
    pa\xEDs."
  _realWorldEn: Dengue, spread by the Aedes aegypti mosquito, peaks in Brazil's rainy
    summer, and 2024 had the highest number of cases ever recorded in the country.
  _tradeOffs: Eliminar criadouros, vacinar e preparar os postos antes do pico custa
    menos que socorrer durante a epidemia.
  _tradeOffsEn: Removing breeding sites, vaccinating and preparing clinics before
    the peak costs less than responding during the epidemic.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Dengue (Minist\xE9rio da Sa\xFAde)"
    Url: https://www.gov.br/saude/pt-br/assuntos/saude-de-a-a-z/d/dengue
  - Label: "Hist\xF3ria da dengue no Brasil (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hist%C3%B3ria_da_dengue_no_Brasil
